    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Distributed Tensor High-Cardinality Stress Tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stress coverage for distributed tensor hot paths under high-cardinality concurrent load: sharded operations, tensor sync, and partition failover.</para>
<sect1 id="test__distributed__tensor__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md21_1s1"><sect2 id="test__distributed__tensor__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md21">
<title>Test cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityShardedOp : concurrent sharded ops at scale</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentTensorSyncStress : concurrent tensor sync under load</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PartitionFailoverStress : partition failover under stress</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
